WEBVTT

00:00:15.130 --> 00:00:17.100
That took me quite some time.

00:00:18.230 --> 00:00:20.670
I'll report to the guild tomorrow.

00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:24.289
Hey, what's wrong? Are you alright?

00:00:25.329 --> 00:00:26.370
Come on!

00:00:30.980 --> 00:00:32.636
She is still breathing.

00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:35.829
Right, I can't just leave her here.

00:02:09.319 --> 00:02:10.455
Wake up.

00:02:11.120 --> 00:02:12.060
(The Farmer and Aspara Town)
Please wake up.

00:02:18.469 --> 00:02:20.319
Great. You woke up.

00:02:21.039 --> 00:02:22.840
I have a question for you.

00:02:24.409 --> 00:02:26.300
Why am I here?

00:02:26.889 --> 00:02:29.680
Did you kidnap me and bring me here?

00:02:30.120 --> 00:02:31.520
No, no!

00:02:31.680 --> 00:02:34.449
I found you by the roadside, so I brought you here.

00:02:34.770 --> 00:02:37.860
You kidnapped me while I was unconscious?

00:02:38.039 --> 00:02:40.930
I didn't. I brought you here because I was worried.

00:02:42.199 --> 00:02:43.169
Worried?

00:02:43.479 --> 00:02:46.580
Anyone would be worried
if they saw someone unconscious lying by the roadside.

00:02:47.120 --> 00:02:48.560
What on earth happened to you?

00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:52.629
Well, good thing you're fine.

00:02:53.430 --> 00:02:54.280
The guild.

00:02:55.340 --> 00:02:59.289
I was heading to the Adventurers' Guild
at the royal capital to issue a quest.

00:03:00.050 --> 00:03:01.199
So that explains it.

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:02.340
Goodbye.

00:03:02.710 --> 00:03:04.569
Wait, I'll escort you there.

00:03:04.969 --> 00:03:05.789
What?

00:03:06.479 --> 00:03:08.400
I need to go to the guild too.

00:03:09.110 --> 00:03:10.580
I'll make breakfast now.

00:03:10.860 --> 00:03:11.599
But...

00:03:12.389 --> 00:03:15.219
I'm Al, Al Wayne.

00:03:18.659 --> 00:03:19.569
What's your name?

00:03:20.770 --> 00:03:23.469
Linea, Linea Magnel.

00:03:23.780 --> 00:03:24.990
Nice meeting you, Linea.

00:03:28.719 --> 00:03:30.360
Al, are you home?

00:03:31.849 --> 00:03:34.580
You're home, right? I just dropped by to see you.

00:03:39.250 --> 00:03:40.680
You... You... You...

00:03:41.080 --> 00:03:42.949
How is it? Is it too big?

00:03:43.599 --> 00:03:45.780
It's fine. I can make do.

00:03:46.310 --> 00:03:48.250
I'm sorry to have stained your bed.

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:53.030
Wearing Al's clothes? Having his bed stained?

00:03:53.439 --> 00:03:54.379
Excuse me,

00:03:54.879 --> 00:03:56.050
who are you?

00:03:57.909 --> 00:04:00.000
Shame on you!

00:04:00.280 --> 00:04:02.770
Al is an asshole!

00:04:04.509 --> 00:04:08.090
Ah, she must have misunderstood.

00:04:08.280 --> 00:04:09.460
I agree.

00:04:09.560 --> 00:04:13.580
Alright, I'll explain this to Ruri for you.

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:15.270
Thank you very much.

00:04:15.879 --> 00:04:16.699
By the way,

00:04:17.709 --> 00:04:19.889
she wants to issue a quest through the guild.

00:04:22.939 --> 00:04:25.959
Oh I see, to investigate the anomaly in your town, right?

00:04:26.319 --> 00:04:27.819
Can you be specific?

00:04:28.180 --> 00:04:29.610
I don't know how to put it.

00:04:29.930 --> 00:04:31.720
Anyway, something is just wrong in my town.

00:04:32.519 --> 00:04:35.660
Oh dear, that's too vague.

00:04:36.060 --> 00:04:38.660
I'm not sure if anyone would be willing to take the quest.

00:04:39.199 --> 00:04:42.730
Well, are you an adventurer?

00:04:43.310 --> 00:04:45.509
Are you strong?

00:04:45.810 --> 00:04:47.790
Me? Just average.

00:04:48.449 --> 00:04:50.009
After all, my actual job is a farmer.

00:04:50.180 --> 00:04:51.100
What?

00:04:51.100 --> 00:04:51.879
Alright.

00:04:52.339 --> 00:04:54.149
I can take the quest if you don't mind.

00:04:55.350 --> 00:04:56.329
Al-kun?

00:04:56.720 --> 00:04:59.689
She desperately made her way here,
and even fainted by the roadside.

00:05:00.250 --> 00:05:02.670
I think the anomaly she talked of should be true.

00:05:03.319 --> 00:05:05.430
So, I want to go there and look into it.

00:05:06.699 --> 00:05:09.209
Well then, I'll leave the quest to you then.

00:05:09.470 --> 00:05:11.660
By the way, which town is it?

00:05:12.230 --> 00:05:13.120
Gal Town.

00:05:13.560 --> 00:05:15.069
Gal Town?!

00:05:15.550 --> 00:05:16.889
What's wrong?

00:05:16.889 --> 00:05:20.529
Isn't Gal Town super famous for its aspara?
(*A vegetable in another world)

00:05:20.680 --> 00:05:23.800
The aspara in Gal is greatly different
from those in other places.

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:25.699
Its flavor, freshness and texture...

00:05:25.699 --> 00:05:28.199
And the sweet bitterness that lingers in the mouth

00:05:28.199 --> 00:05:31.199
is the greatest masterpiece that gives a sense
of longing for the distant hometown.

00:05:31.199 --> 00:05:32.579
After all, that is the ultimate aspara

00:05:32.579 --> 00:05:36.939
that even the celebrity Descortes
described as "I think of aspara, therefore I am."

00:05:37.449 --> 00:05:39.500
You're just exaggerating.

00:05:39.699 --> 00:05:40.899
He isn't, actually.

00:05:40.899 --> 00:05:41.860
It is true?!

00:05:41.990 --> 00:05:44.680
It's such an honor to meet someone from Gal Town.

00:05:44.680 --> 00:05:46.850
Please shake my hands!
I have no ulterior motives!

00:05:47.019 --> 00:05:51.399
He's a bit weird, but he should be able to help you.

00:05:51.689 --> 00:05:53.439
So, you can trust him.

00:05:56.199 --> 00:05:58.000
Thank you for the clothes.

00:05:58.910 --> 00:06:01.269
Yeah, it suits you well.

00:06:02.819 --> 00:06:04.639
Why are you so nice to me?

00:06:05.069 --> 00:06:07.990
Do you want me to marry you in return?

00:06:08.449 --> 00:06:10.379
Who do you think I am?

00:06:11.850 --> 00:06:13.990
A wolf trying to swoop in?

00:06:14.509 --> 00:06:15.899
I'm going to eat you.

00:06:15.899 --> 00:06:18.699
Do you dislike me?

00:06:18.920 --> 00:06:20.540
My dad said

00:06:20.970 --> 00:06:23.720
no man would help a woman without ulterior motives.

00:06:23.920 --> 00:06:25.689
Men are all like wolves.

00:06:27.129 --> 00:06:31.490
It's right for you to stay alert when you're alone.

00:06:32.430 --> 00:06:35.550
But I mean no harm. You can rest assured.

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:39.439
Those who say so may try to lower your guard

00:06:39.439 --> 00:06:42.430
and take advantage of you,
so I must be careful. It's my dad's reminder.

00:06:42.430 --> 00:06:44.160
What a discreet father!

00:06:44.720 --> 00:06:49.120
So, I will only go with trustworthy people.

00:06:52.610 --> 00:06:54.509
I'm going to watch you at a close distance for a while

00:06:54.509 --> 00:06:56.850
so that I can find out whether you're trustworthy or not.

00:06:56.990 --> 00:06:58.689
Oh, okay.

00:06:58.689 --> 00:07:01.990
So, let's head to Gal Town then.

00:07:04.949 --> 00:07:06.949
Al, you...

00:07:08.339 --> 00:07:10.759
Helen-san is a big liar!

00:07:14.139 --> 00:07:15.680
Oh my, thank God!

00:07:16.290 --> 00:07:19.110
It's too hard to find a carriage to Gal Town.

00:07:19.519 --> 00:07:23.290
That town has no trade with any other city now.

00:07:23.839 --> 00:07:25.329
That's probably why.

00:07:25.759 --> 00:07:27.009
Oh, I see.

00:07:36.040 --> 00:07:36.889
Can it be...

00:07:42.189 --> 00:07:43.600
Oh, an orc?

00:07:44.139 --> 00:07:47.339
Don't worry. We can get rid of it. Rest assured...

00:07:48.389 --> 00:07:50.019
A group of orcs!

00:07:50.189 --> 00:07:52.420
What the heck! What on earth happened?

00:07:54.060 --> 00:07:57.379
Sorry. It's probably because of me.

00:07:57.769 --> 00:07:58.579
Al-san!

00:07:58.910 --> 00:08:01.149
Al-san, hang on! Al-san!

00:08:09.610 --> 00:08:11.009
Sorry.

00:08:11.970 --> 00:08:14.259
Why did you apologize to me after waking up?

00:08:14.850 --> 00:08:17.410
Are you having a guilty conscience?

00:08:17.410 --> 00:08:18.709
No, no!

00:08:19.509 --> 00:08:22.120
Eh, what's this?

00:08:22.490 --> 00:08:26.649
Just like mine, it's a pendant that can soothe the nerves.

00:08:27.420 --> 00:08:31.230
It's better than nothing. Just wear it.

00:08:31.579 --> 00:08:33.990
I see, thank you.

00:08:36.418 --> 00:08:37.519
We seem to have arrived.

00:08:42.100 --> 00:08:44.970
She's a good girl.

00:08:44.990 --> 00:08:45.799
What?

00:08:46.610 --> 00:08:47.809
After we got rid of the orcs,

00:08:48.009 --> 00:08:50.649
she put you who were haunted by nightmares on her knees,

00:08:51.159 --> 00:08:54.169
stroking your head and comforting you gently.

00:08:54.730 --> 00:08:57.149
She kept saying, "There, there. You'll be fine."

00:09:01.549 --> 00:09:03.139
This is Gal Town.

00:09:03.710 --> 00:09:06.710
Stop! We've never seen you. What are you doing here?

00:09:06.919 --> 00:09:08.279
Oh, I'm...

00:09:09.080 --> 00:09:10.590
He's my guest.

00:09:11.570 --> 00:09:13.330
Oh, it's you, Linea.

00:09:13.590 --> 00:09:15.730
I'm sorry. You may enter now.

00:09:25.250 --> 00:09:26.519
Why are they holding mops?

00:09:33.029 --> 00:09:34.929
There are plenty of people in the streets.

00:09:37.519 --> 00:09:38.529
Please give me one skewer.

00:09:38.600 --> 00:09:39.529
No problem.

00:09:41.210 --> 00:09:45.220
Oh right, it's said that
something strange has happened in town.

00:09:45.460 --> 00:09:47.340
You're so weird.

00:09:47.679 --> 00:09:49.850
Look yourself. Everything is at peace.

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:53.480
But didn't you cut off the trade with other towns?

00:09:53.539 --> 00:09:56.500
It's the lord's decision. How would I know?

00:09:57.429 --> 00:09:58.299
Here you are. This is your skewer.

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:01.460
Hey, it's burnt.

00:10:01.850 --> 00:10:03.559
It doesn't matter.

00:10:04.019 --> 00:10:04.889
Is this...

00:10:05.399 --> 00:10:08.919
the standard way of eating aspara in your town?
(*A vegetable in another world)

00:10:09.090 --> 00:10:10.850
How is it possible?

00:10:11.509 --> 00:10:14.269
It doesn't matter. It doesn't matter.

00:10:14.659 --> 00:10:19.299
It doesn't matter.

00:10:24.899 --> 00:10:25.840
Are you alright?

00:10:32.470 --> 00:10:34.529
Hey, don't ruin the vegetables.

00:10:44.490 --> 00:10:45.649
Something is wrong.

00:10:45.950 --> 00:10:47.320
Something is wrong with the people here.

00:10:49.110 --> 00:10:51.679
This cargo is thin and long. Hold it firmly.

00:10:51.679 --> 00:10:53.370
Al-san!

00:10:57.330 --> 00:10:59.240
What bad luck!

00:10:59.899 --> 00:11:02.429
I was mistaken as a cargo and got carried away.

00:11:02.549 --> 00:11:04.990
The townspeople have all been acting this way.

00:11:06.610 --> 00:11:08.350
Something is wrong with them indeed.

00:11:08.919 --> 00:11:11.389
For now, come to my home for a rest.

00:11:14.620 --> 00:11:16.639
We sell pendants.

00:11:18.659 --> 00:11:21.789
This pendant has the blessings of the Good God.

00:11:22.009 --> 00:11:24.440
It has a strong effect to eliminate evil.

00:11:25.159 --> 00:11:26.759
Is this the one you put on me in the carriage?

00:11:27.000 --> 00:11:27.649
Yeah.

00:11:28.100 --> 00:11:32.070
This is probably the thing that prevents us
from becoming like the townspeople.

00:11:32.840 --> 00:11:34.149
Do you have more of this?

00:11:34.610 --> 00:11:37.120
You can take it for the purpose of investigation.

00:11:37.590 --> 00:11:40.480
But there aren't enough pendants for all the townspeople.

00:11:41.320 --> 00:11:43.590
By the way, where are your parents?

00:11:44.340 --> 00:11:45.490
I don't know.

00:11:46.409 --> 00:11:49.429
They've been missing since the anomaly arose in town.

00:11:51.419 --> 00:11:54.120
I'll have to investigate that too.

00:11:55.580 --> 00:11:56.419
Al-san.

00:11:57.950 --> 00:12:00.159
No, it's nothing.

00:12:01.059 --> 00:12:03.350
I'll leave the investigation to you then.

00:12:05.779 --> 00:12:08.370
How about an aspara crepe?
(*A vegetable in another world)

00:12:08.600 --> 00:12:11.299
Come and try the delicious aspara juice!

00:12:12.370 --> 00:12:15.620
They can't communicate normally indeed.

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:18.500
Oh, there is a stranger.

00:12:22.200 --> 00:12:23.080
Who are you?

00:12:23.730 --> 00:12:25.029
Excuse me.

00:12:25.370 --> 00:12:29.049
I'm Remul Holn, the lord of Gal Town.

00:12:29.519 --> 00:12:33.620
You're Remul-san who achieved
the Aspara Revolution in this town, right?

00:12:34.200 --> 00:12:35.879
It's my honor to meet you.

00:12:37.129 --> 00:12:40.629
Exactly, Gal Town is with aspara.

00:12:40.919 --> 00:12:42.620
By the way, your pendant

00:12:44.009 --> 00:12:45.919
is the same as mine.

00:12:46.340 --> 00:12:49.740
So, you must know the situation in this town, right?

00:12:50.149 --> 00:12:52.100
I have a lot of questions to ask you.

00:12:52.610 --> 00:12:53.779
Sure thing.

00:12:54.019 --> 00:12:56.340
It's a long story though.

00:12:56.600 --> 00:13:00.370
Would you like to have dinner at my place?

00:13:00.860 --> 00:13:01.769
No problem.

00:13:03.450 --> 00:13:04.779
Again?!

00:13:04.909 --> 00:13:07.409
I'll pay you a visit later.

00:13:09.399 --> 00:13:11.059
I'm looking forward to your visit.

00:13:13.700 --> 00:13:16.889
Oh my goodness. I just can't lower my guard at all.

00:13:16.919 --> 00:13:19.370
Al-san, don't you find it strange?

00:13:20.129 --> 00:13:22.250
Indeed, the townspeople are all...

00:13:22.419 --> 00:13:23.789
I mean the lord.

00:13:24.259 --> 00:13:27.620
He's sane, but why does he stay in this town?

00:13:28.179 --> 00:13:30.769
Looks like he doesn't mean to ask for help at all.

00:13:32.889 --> 00:13:34.120
You're right.

00:13:34.370 --> 00:13:36.019
But there may be some unknown reason.

00:13:37.070 --> 00:13:40.669
Anyway, we'll know after hearing him out tonight.

00:13:43.289 --> 00:13:46.309
You had better not think too highly of others.

00:13:48.019 --> 00:13:51.769
You'll get taken in by bad people easily.

00:13:52.320 --> 00:13:53.629
No worries.

00:13:53.990 --> 00:13:56.919
I won't go to the lord's mansion without preparations.

00:13:57.649 --> 00:14:00.409
Just don't worry.

00:14:02.600 --> 00:14:03.490
OK.

00:14:05.169 --> 00:14:06.929
So, this is the lord's mansion.

00:14:07.840 --> 00:14:09.990
Hopefully, we can find answers here.

00:14:23.539 --> 00:14:24.500
Impressive.

00:14:25.049 --> 00:14:27.259
Clearly, he deeply loves aspara.

00:14:29.919 --> 00:14:31.559
Welcome.

00:14:32.429 --> 00:14:34.190
Please take a seat.

00:14:36.840 --> 00:14:38.700
Thank you for having us here.

00:14:39.350 --> 00:14:42.169
I'll cut to the chase. Do you have any ideas

00:14:42.370 --> 00:14:44.080
about the anomaly in Gal Town?

00:14:45.350 --> 00:14:46.860
Well,

00:14:47.320 --> 00:14:49.549
where should I start?

00:14:49.809 --> 00:14:50.659
It's just that

00:14:51.649 --> 00:14:55.139
it's no longer your concern.

00:14:59.059 --> 00:15:01.509
What do you mean?

00:15:02.029 --> 00:15:03.250
Nothing.

00:15:03.419 --> 00:15:06.870
I just want you to do me a favor.

00:15:07.379 --> 00:15:09.919
I see. You want to play hardball, right?

00:15:10.730 --> 00:15:11.669
What a pity.

00:15:17.769 --> 00:15:21.570
You're wrong if you think this can make me yield.

00:15:27.580 --> 00:15:28.460
Linea?

00:15:28.690 --> 00:15:30.279
I've told you, Al-san.

00:15:30.679 --> 00:15:33.700
Don't think too highly of others.

00:15:35.409 --> 00:15:37.309
Linea-kun, you did a good job.

00:15:37.730 --> 00:15:40.720
Thanks to you, my plan has moved forward to another step.

00:15:41.210 --> 00:15:42.139
Plan?

00:15:42.490 --> 00:15:43.379
Exactly.

00:15:43.970 --> 00:15:47.769
The grand plan of ruling all humans.

00:15:48.149 --> 00:15:48.870
What?!

00:15:51.080 --> 00:15:53.809
Here is a heads-up for you before you become my slave.

00:15:55.610 --> 00:15:59.840
I'm Vritra, a noble demon.

00:16:01.389 --> 00:16:04.750
I can take away the thoughts of the person I possess.

00:16:05.009 --> 00:16:07.090
Just like this lord.

00:16:07.320 --> 00:16:10.870
Yet, in that case, I can only manipulate one person.

00:16:11.029 --> 00:16:11.960
So,

00:16:12.659 --> 00:16:16.539
I've condensed my power into a crystal

00:16:16.820 --> 00:16:20.429
and buried it inside the goddess statue
in the middle of the town.

00:16:20.899 --> 00:16:23.149
That's why Gal Town becomes like this.

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:26.799
My next target is the royal capital.

00:16:26.950 --> 00:16:29.629
I happen to hear an interesting rumor.

00:16:29.659 --> 00:16:33.500
There is a human who defeated Romeo and Ouroboros.

00:16:35.279 --> 00:16:38.149
If I can plant the crystal into that guy's body

00:16:38.149 --> 00:16:40.429
and rule over all humans through him,

00:16:40.700 --> 00:16:44.230
I'll rise to fame among demons.

00:16:44.539 --> 00:16:45.379
In other words,

00:16:45.820 --> 00:16:50.240
from the very beginning, you've been part of my plan.

00:16:50.259 --> 00:16:51.399
Al Wayne!

00:16:52.600 --> 00:16:53.779
Is what he said true?

00:16:54.070 --> 00:16:55.009
No!

00:16:55.269 --> 00:16:59.389
It was a coincidence that I fainted
on the way and got rescued by you.

00:17:01.820 --> 00:17:03.820
Linea, you're so outrageous.

00:17:03.820 --> 00:17:05.163
How dare you bite the hand that feeds you!

00:17:06.039 --> 00:17:06.960
I didn't!

00:17:07.163 --> 00:17:10.700
It's because you're holding my parents hostage!

00:17:11.163 --> 00:17:13.163
So that explains it.

00:17:13.163 --> 00:17:13.460
So that explains it.
Alright, that's enough chitchat.

00:17:13.460 --> 00:17:16.836
Alright, that's enough chitchat.

00:17:17.163 --> 00:17:20.836
You should know the consequences of revolting against me.

00:17:21.163 --> 00:17:22.480
I got it.

00:17:24.836 --> 00:17:25.210
Do as you wish.

00:17:25.836 --> 00:17:26.836
Al-san.

00:17:29.359 --> 00:17:31.910
I like smart people like you.

00:17:32.809 --> 00:17:35.619
Let's get started then.

00:17:39.019 --> 00:17:41.380
Are you strong?

00:17:41.990 --> 00:17:43.930
Me? Just average.

00:17:44.690 --> 00:17:46.069
After all, my actual job is a farmer.

00:17:46.819 --> 00:17:48.640
I can take the quest if you don't mind.

00:17:49.819 --> 00:17:51.809
I won't go to the lord's mansion without preparations.

00:17:52.519 --> 00:17:54.549
Just don't worry.

00:17:56.809 --> 00:17:57.700
No!

00:17:58.730 --> 00:18:01.019
Don't! Run! Al-san!

00:18:01.490 --> 00:18:02.710
It's too late.

00:18:13.400 --> 00:18:14.960
What the heck! A smoke screen?

00:18:15.039 --> 00:18:16.150
By now...

00:18:17.359 --> 00:18:18.210
What's going on?

00:18:20.900 --> 00:18:22.789
Is the goddess statue destroyed?

00:18:27.009 --> 00:18:29.079
Asshole, what stone is that?

00:18:29.079 --> 00:18:31.049
It's merely for communication.

00:18:31.700 --> 00:18:34.430
It's my partner who destroyed the goddess statue.

00:18:34.660 --> 00:18:39.740
Partners? Impossible. I've made that girl spy on you!

00:18:39.740 --> 00:18:43.049
What if I've done something while Linea wasn't around?

00:18:43.329 --> 00:18:46.049
How is it possible? How could you have the time?

00:18:46.329 --> 00:18:50.309
I've got rid of her surveillance at least twice.

00:18:51.130 --> 00:18:52.000
That was

00:18:52.170 --> 00:18:54.519
when I was taken away by the merchants.

00:18:55.930 --> 00:18:59.549
Back then, I thought it was the townspeople
who carried me away.

00:19:00.589 --> 00:19:04.609
Actually, they are my partners
in the royal capital who came out of worry.

00:19:05.559 --> 00:19:09.849
They noticed the anomaly upon reaching Gal Town
and conducted an investigation.

00:19:10.579 --> 00:19:12.890
So, the second time I was carried away by them...

00:19:13.569 --> 00:19:17.369
We are sure that the townspeople
are being controlled by the goddess statue.

00:19:17.839 --> 00:19:20.880
Al, you'll sneak into the lord's mansion.
Once you make sure the lord is the mastermind,

00:19:20.990 --> 00:19:22.960
we'll destroy the goddess statue.

00:19:24.250 --> 00:19:26.430
But how should I contact you?

00:19:27.940 --> 00:19:29.730
You can use this stone.

00:19:30.180 --> 00:19:33.500
Smash it and my stone will sparkle.

00:19:35.450 --> 00:19:37.069
This was it.

00:19:37.690 --> 00:19:41.269
Did you give the spare pendants to them?

00:19:41.750 --> 00:19:42.640
Yeah.

00:19:45.250 --> 00:19:47.119
Alright, this has got to end.

00:19:47.700 --> 00:19:51.000
My partners have gone to rescue Linea's parents.

00:19:55.839 --> 00:19:57.089
Idiot!

00:19:57.250 --> 00:19:59.380
I have one more hostage.

00:19:59.890 --> 00:20:03.809
I'll kill the lord if you dare to come near. Just surrender.

00:20:04.529 --> 00:20:05.410
Al-san!

00:20:05.640 --> 00:20:08.140
Lord-sama, I know.

00:20:08.839 --> 00:20:12.640
I know the lord of this town loves aspara dearly.

00:20:13.609 --> 00:20:14.630
In that case,

00:20:15.380 --> 00:20:16.279
look at this!

00:20:17.269 --> 00:20:22.329
What? Big deal! It's merely human food.

00:20:22.670 --> 00:20:24.400
This is not ordinary food.

00:20:25.710 --> 00:20:26.890
This aspara is really something.

00:20:26.890 --> 00:20:32.359
It's the greatest masterpiece cultivated by
the people and the lord of Gal Town with love!

00:20:32.440 --> 00:20:35.109
How can a crappy demon like you deny it?

00:20:35.289 --> 00:20:36.990
If you still act as his puppet,

00:20:37.170 --> 00:20:39.519
the aspara will be ruined.

00:20:39.579 --> 00:20:41.730
Can you bear with it, Lord-sama?

00:20:43.730 --> 00:20:46.460
The sweetness and rich fragrance

00:20:46.869 --> 00:20:49.910
are what I've been pursuing for decades.

00:20:50.049 --> 00:20:53.410
How can I forget my love for aspara?

00:20:55.180 --> 00:20:59.089
How can I be defeated by a human?

00:21:06.619 --> 00:21:08.789
Thank you for everything.

00:21:09.720 --> 00:21:12.039
By the way, are you really going to let me have this?

00:21:12.299 --> 00:21:16.109
Yes, please keep it as a talisman.

00:21:16.910 --> 00:21:17.720
And...

00:21:22.990 --> 00:21:25.849
When I'm old enough, I'll go to the royal capital for you.

00:21:26.269 --> 00:21:28.680
By then, even if you have a girlfriend,

00:21:28.950 --> 00:21:31.859
I'll definitely win you back. Be prepared.

00:21:32.500 --> 00:21:35.200
What? What? What?

00:21:35.460 --> 00:21:37.410
Goodbye. Take care.

00:21:37.460 --> 00:21:39.309
Oh, okay.

00:21:39.559 --> 00:21:40.890
Bye, see you.

00:21:44.160 --> 00:21:45.039
Al-kun!

00:21:45.039 --> 00:21:46.690
Not me! Not me!

00:21:46.690 --> 00:21:47.940
Shame on you!

00:21:48.890 --> 00:21:51.009
Al-san, next time,

00:21:51.930 --> 00:21:53.619
I'll kiss you right here.

00:23:29.549 --> 00:23:39.980
(Episode 11: The Reunion of the Farmer
and the Demon King's Castle)
